WEBVTT

00:01.560 --> 00:06.630
Allen, this one wants to come with us.

00:06.630 --> 00:09.270
You're ready to part with 
your precious child?

00:09.880 --> 00:12.940
Wouldn't you miss your family?

00:13.650 --> 00:17.660
You are from the Grol region, correct?

00:17.660 --> 00:21.380
A fenrir can come back here 
in just under an hour.

00:21.940 --> 00:25.660
I see, so it's nothing more than a homestay.

00:26.460 --> 00:29.410
Good, then come to my house.

00:29.800 --> 00:32.080
Please get along with Charlotte!

00:32.930 --> 00:34.380
Are you sure?

00:34.380 --> 00:36.920
Not only me, but also this little one...

00:36.920 --> 00:38.540
I don't mind.

00:38.540 --> 00:42.670
My mansion is big and has plenty 
of places to take walks.

00:43.380 --> 00:46.690
Plus, it's a good thing to 
have more family, right?

00:46.690 --> 00:48.630
F-Family?

00:49.500 --> 00:51.190
You mean me, too?

00:51.420 --> 00:53.890
Don't make me say the obvious.

00:53.890 --> 00:56.200
You're practically my family.

01:00.340 --> 01:01.480
What's wrong?

01:01.480 --> 01:04.180
Did I say something weird?

01:04.180 --> 01:06.720
N-No, it's nothing...

01:07.880 --> 01:11.250
My bro is so dense yet bold.

01:11.250 --> 01:13.410
An unconscious womanizer...

01:14.420 --> 01:16.710
W-Why are you here?!

01:16.710 --> 01:18.940
As a token of apology for causing trouble,

01:18.940 --> 01:21.960
I wish to be the bodyguard 
for Lady Charlotte.

01:21.960 --> 01:25.340
Excuse me, I've been meaning to ask...

01:26.030 --> 01:27.770
Who might you be?

01:28.970 --> 01:31.510
Surely, you jest.

01:31.510 --> 01:33.740
I'm your family who loves you.

01:33.740 --> 01:35.570
Don't call yourself family 
without permission!

01:35.570 --> 01:37.480
Go back to the zoo!

01:37.750 --> 01:43.740
Please come back to our hotel 
again for your real honeymoon!

01:47.040 --> 01:51.630
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

03:15.500 --> 03:19.970
<b>Naughty Resident</b>

03:17.460 --> 03:21.210
Well then, I'll go on a walk with Lü.

03:21.810 --> 03:22.610
Okay.

03:26.230 --> 03:28.720
Lü, I'm counting on you 
to protect Charlotte!

03:31.540 --> 03:32.860
<i>Oh?</i>

03:33.330 --> 03:35.420
Let's go, Lü.

03:41.470 --> 03:46.220
<i>After the trip to the Yunoha region, 
Lü, a fenrir, joined our family.</i>

03:46.220 --> 03:52.360
And now you have less time to enjoy doing 
naughty things with Lady Charlotte.

03:54.030 --> 03:58.870
You seem sad that Lü has taken 
Lady Charlotte away from you.

03:59.140 --> 04:02.400
Gosetsu, how long are 
you going to stay here?

04:02.400 --> 04:04.750
How long? Please.

04:04.750 --> 04:07.900
I'm Lady Charlotte's family, after all.

04:08.270 --> 04:10.790
I'm not on board with that.

04:10.790 --> 04:12.990
Don't be so cold.

04:12.990 --> 04:17.390
Surely you love Lady Charlotte 
as much as I do, Master Allen?

04:17.390 --> 04:19.140
L-Love?!

04:23.490 --> 04:26.900
I-I do, as family, that is.

04:26.900 --> 04:28.000
<i>Smirk.</i>

04:28.660 --> 04:32.170
<i>Just as this hell capybara points out,</i>

04:32.170 --> 04:36.790
<i>I feel rather sad to have 
less time with Charlotte.</i>

04:38.710 --> 04:42.930
<i>But I'm happy that she has a goal now.</i>

04:43.260 --> 04:46.300
<i>A goal of becoming a magical creature tamer.</i>

04:48.800 --> 04:51.210
<i>On the night we came back 
from the Yunoha region...</i>

04:53.240 --> 04:58.700
Allen, I'd like to properly learn about 
becoming a magical creature tamer.

04:59.330 --> 05:01.620
<i>She's become so positive.</i>

05:02.410 --> 05:04.160
<i>When she first came here,</i>

05:04.160 --> 05:07.630
<i>all she did was count the grains 
of the wooden floor for hours...</i>

05:08.270 --> 05:09.450
Very well.

05:09.450 --> 05:12.610
I will teach you everything you 
need to know, starting with the basics.

05:14.030 --> 05:15.720
Thank you very much!

05:17.980 --> 05:23.830
<i>Ever since then, Charlotte has been nothing 
but diligent, excellent, and quick to learn.</i>

05:23.830 --> 05:28.460
<i>She was devoted enough to spend every 
night reviewing and previewing materials.</i>

05:28.720 --> 05:33.580
<i>She's a brilliant student who's highly 
motivated to research things on her own.</i>

05:38.650 --> 05:41.590
<i>Since Charlotte started studying 
to become a magical creature tamer,</i>

05:41.590 --> 05:45.730
<i>I'm discovering a new side to her every day.</i>

05:47.190 --> 05:48.860
Now, you try.

05:50.350 --> 05:51.720
Okay...

05:53.480 --> 05:54.630
Here I go.

06:01.090 --> 06:02.390
If you please.

06:32.510 --> 06:34.900
Well done, Lü!

06:36.480 --> 06:38.270
You've mastered it.

06:38.270 --> 06:42.120
I don't believe anyone has been able to 
communicate with fenrirs the way you have.

06:43.350 --> 06:45.000
You are indeed a genius.

06:45.000 --> 06:47.660
As expected of my beloved student.

06:47.950 --> 06:53.170
Was that your excuse to tell 
her she's your "beloved"?

06:54.050 --> 06:55.720
Of course not!

06:55.720 --> 06:57.750
Seriously, you need to leave!

06:57.750 --> 06:59.800
Please return to the zoo!

06:59.800 --> 07:02.510
How many times must I tell you?

07:02.510 --> 07:04.450
This is my home.

07:05.620 --> 07:08.470
Here. Your treat, Lü.

07:09.530 --> 07:12.900
Charlotte did pretty well, but so did you.

07:17.690 --> 07:18.830
Lü?!

07:18.830 --> 07:21.320
You shouldn't bite others!

07:22.840 --> 07:25.090
I'm sorry, Allen.

07:26.870 --> 07:28.500
No, it's all right.

07:28.500 --> 07:34.860
But like I said, it proves that you're the 
only one who can build trust with Lü.

07:35.440 --> 07:36.870
I'm sure it's not...

07:36.870 --> 07:38.210
Indeed.

07:38.210 --> 07:40.870
The way I see it, I believe Lady Charlotte

07:40.870 --> 07:45.970
has reached the level of 
having Beast Conversation.

07:46.240 --> 07:48.930
Beast Conversation...

07:48.930 --> 07:51.690
That's the magic to automatically 
replace the language

07:51.690 --> 07:56.250
of magical creatures you've bonded to
with human language, correct?

07:56.250 --> 07:58.910
You've studied thoroughly.

07:59.290 --> 08:01.000
Thank you.

08:01.000 --> 08:03.690
It was described in the 
book I read the other day.

08:04.480 --> 08:09.640
Speaking of which, why is Gosetsu 
able to communicate with us?

08:09.640 --> 08:10.940
Good point.

08:10.940 --> 08:13.120
Is it some sort of spell?

08:13.570 --> 08:15.520
If there's a trick to it, I'd like to—

08:15.520 --> 08:17.010
I'm self-taught!

08:17.480 --> 08:22.760
I've lived such a long time that I 
learned the human language on my own.

08:26.380 --> 08:31.950
B-But I've never heard of Beast 
Conversation working on a fenrir.

08:32.380 --> 08:34.890
Isn't it too early to try?

08:36.360 --> 08:38.650
Please let me try!

08:58.170 --> 09:00.040
Beast Conversation.

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beast Conversation</b>

09:10.340 --> 09:14.180
Lü... Can you try and say something?

09:16.440 --> 09:17.880
Don't lose heart.

09:17.880 --> 09:20.210
It's only natural that you can't 
use this level of spell—

09:20.210 --> 09:23.450
Why the hell are you touching my mommy?

09:24.700 --> 09:27.470
Lü! You can use our language!

09:27.470 --> 09:28.280
What?

09:28.280 --> 09:29.790
Oh, yeah!

09:29.790 --> 09:31.950
I'm talking to Mommy!

09:31.950 --> 09:33.270
"Mommy"?!

09:33.270 --> 09:36.080
But I'm happy to be speaking with you!

09:36.080 --> 09:37.880
Yay!

09:37.880 --> 09:40.370
Wait, Lü! Hold on!

09:42.510 --> 09:46.480
I told you, she is special.

09:46.930 --> 09:49.480
She is my beloved student.

09:54.600 --> 10:00.300
But it looks like Lü really does hate you.

10:00.300 --> 10:04.010
That's not true... is it...?

10:10.960 --> 10:12.340
Wow!

10:12.970 --> 10:17.040
I thought Lü should have a special bathing area.

10:17.040 --> 10:19.510
It's a gift to celebrate being 
able to speak with Lü.

10:19.510 --> 10:21.630
Th-Thank you very much!

10:22.340 --> 10:24.370
Isn't that nice, Lü?

10:24.370 --> 10:25.270
Yeah!

10:25.580 --> 10:27.050
Come on, Lü.

10:27.050 --> 10:29.530
You should say thank you.

10:31.420 --> 10:32.550
Thank you...

10:33.310 --> 10:37.040
Lü, do you think you can 
try a little louder?

10:37.270 --> 10:39.170
Being able to say it at all is enough.

10:39.170 --> 10:41.520
Go, play and have fun.

10:44.310 --> 10:46.610
Why are <i>you</i> the first one to use it?!

10:46.610 --> 10:48.600
Because we're family.

10:48.600 --> 10:50.830
It's for fenrirs and humans only!

10:50.830 --> 10:53.550
It's not meant to be 
used by hell capybaras!

10:54.790 --> 10:57.800
Wouldn't that be discrimination 
against capybaras?

11:00.650 --> 11:03.110
I'm going in, too!

11:06.300 --> 11:07.980
You splashed me, Lü!

11:06.640 --> 11:09.160
Here! Here!

11:11.760 --> 11:15.030
If capybaras are barred from 
using it, then I have no choice.

11:17.260 --> 11:20.110
Hell Forest Rat Style Secret Technique!

11:20.470 --> 11:22.310
Shimmering Water!

11:33.320 --> 11:35.230
What?!

11:35.590 --> 11:39.100
It's the transformation technique 
I obtained so I might partake

11:39.100 --> 11:41.710
in what humans call "gourmet food" in town...

11:41.710 --> 11:43.350
It's the perfect chance to try it.

11:43.580 --> 11:45.200
What do you think?

11:46.890 --> 11:48.580
I mean... are you...

11:49.440 --> 11:51.100
a female?

11:51.350 --> 11:52.950
<i>That's</i> your reaction?

11:53.600 --> 11:55.850
Lü, it's cold!

11:59.560 --> 12:01.190
It's so peaceful...

12:02.220 --> 12:05.870
<i>I wish days like this could go on forever.</i>

12:06.240 --> 12:09.270
<i>But that's rather out of character for me.</i>

12:10.920 --> 12:16.080
<i>But look how much she's changed
since she first arrived here...</i>

12:15.460 --> 12:16.830
Lü!

12:18.380 --> 12:20.380
<i>Something's wrong with my heart?!</i>

12:20.380 --> 12:23.200
<i>Perhaps I stopped it too often...</i>

12:26.600 --> 12:28.010
<i>Or, is it...?</i>

12:30.650 --> 12:33.140
Allen, what's wrong?

12:33.140 --> 12:35.450
It's nothing.

12:35.450 --> 12:38.930
In any case, Charlotte, don't 
you want to get out soon?

12:39.640 --> 12:41.150
Huh? Whoa!

12:42.840 --> 12:44.390
I suppose.

12:45.010 --> 12:48.400
Lü and Gosetsu, would you like 
to stay and play a bit longer?

12:48.400 --> 12:49.390
Yup!

12:49.390 --> 12:50.410
Yes.

12:51.510 --> 12:53.740
Then I'll get out first.

12:53.740 --> 12:55.160
Take your time.

12:55.160 --> 12:55.540
Okay!

12:55.540 --> 12:57.160
Sure.

12:58.460 --> 12:59.790
Allen.

12:59.790 --> 13:00.660
Hm?

13:00.960 --> 13:04.440
I'm so grateful for everything 
you've done for me.

13:04.440 --> 13:06.360
Why so formal?

13:06.360 --> 13:11.520
I told you that I'd teach you everything 
there is to know about naughty things.

13:11.520 --> 13:13.690
This is nothing.

13:14.030 --> 13:17.150
I can even make you a lazy river.

13:18.150 --> 13:22.930
The garden is so big, a lazy 
river here can be a reality.

13:22.930 --> 13:26.740
Right. The former owner of the property

13:26.740 --> 13:29.950
didn't seem to know what to do with 
it, so it was left untouched.

13:30.320 --> 13:34.420
There was someone living here before you?

13:34.420 --> 13:35.130
Yes.

13:35.130 --> 13:38.470
I haven't met them, but it's 
believed that the previous resident...

13:39.390 --> 13:41.720
disappeared.

13:42.000 --> 13:42.790
<i>What?</i>

13:43.490 --> 13:48.650
Apparently, it was an eccentric elf 
who used to live here 30 years ago.

13:48.650 --> 13:51.340
They stayed out of town, were unsociable,

13:51.340 --> 13:54.980
and were always at their desk, 
like they were possessed.

13:54.980 --> 13:58.490
But one day, they suddenly disappeared.

13:58.490 --> 14:02.490
Some say they jumped off the cliff because 
they repeatedly failed at their experiments.

14:02.800 --> 14:06.210
Others say they were eaten by 
the monster they created.

14:06.210 --> 14:08.600
Or their body was taken over by mushrooms

14:08.600 --> 14:11.870
for committing a taboo and 
still wanders about...

14:12.120 --> 14:14.610
Anyhow, because of such rumors,

14:14.610 --> 14:17.870
I got to buy this mansion 
for a much cheaper price...

14:20.000 --> 14:22.380
<i>Shoot, did I go too far?!</i>

14:22.380 --> 14:24.090
I'm sorry, Charlotte—

14:24.090 --> 14:25.280
That...

14:25.280 --> 14:25.870
Hm?

14:26.710 --> 14:28.010
No way!

14:28.630 --> 14:30.220
Hey, Gosetsu!

14:30.660 --> 14:31.880
Are you okay?!

14:34.680 --> 14:36.400
What seems to be the problem?

14:36.400 --> 14:37.940
You're alive!

14:38.980 --> 14:41.200
But what on earth are these?

14:41.910 --> 14:46.980
If you're asking about this 
phenomenon, I cannot explain it.

14:46.980 --> 14:50.400
If you're asking me what these 
are, I'd say they're mushrooms.

14:50.400 --> 14:52.730
Well, I know they're mushrooms—

14:52.730 --> 14:54.400
Hey!

14:56.080 --> 14:59.910
Y'all are the ones who stole 
my precious mushrooms?!

15:01.330 --> 15:02.550
Mushrooms...?

15:02.550 --> 15:04.260
...A ghost?!

15:04.920 --> 15:07.920
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

15:07.920 --> 15:10.930
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

15:12.930 --> 15:17.360
Man, I didn't mean to scare you like that.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.930
My bad!

15:18.930 --> 15:20.050
Right...

15:20.050 --> 15:21.590
Um...

15:22.060 --> 15:24.940
Mister Allen, is it?

15:25.330 --> 15:28.930
I understand now that you weren't 
trying to steal my mushrooms.

15:29.200 --> 15:31.590
Who exactly are you?

15:31.590 --> 15:35.450
Oh, I haven't introduced myself.

15:35.890 --> 15:38.890
I'm Dorothea Gri'mm Wallenstein.

15:38.890 --> 15:42.220
You can call me Dorothea!

15:42.220 --> 15:44.940
Another problematic one...

15:46.130 --> 15:50.460
<i>But hold on, it seems that she's 
been living here for a while,</i>

15:50.460 --> 15:53.360
<i>but I've never felt her presence before.</i>

15:55.020 --> 15:58.350
Are you... a ghost?!

16:01.080 --> 16:03.720
I-I knew you existed!

16:03.720 --> 16:05.380
A ghost?

16:05.380 --> 16:07.100
What are you talking about?

16:07.100 --> 16:09.520
I mean, I'm the one with questions here!

16:09.520 --> 16:11.740
Who exactly are you?

16:13.070 --> 16:14.370
Allen...?

16:15.250 --> 16:16.990
Who are we?

16:16.990 --> 16:19.500
We live in the mansion upstairs.

16:19.500 --> 16:20.540
What?!

16:20.540 --> 16:23.290
The mansion upstairs is mine!

16:23.290 --> 16:25.810
You're not making any sense.

16:26.760 --> 16:31.630
Don't tell me... you're the elf 
who disappeared 30 years ago!

16:31.630 --> 16:33.120
What?!

16:34.880 --> 16:38.430
Thirty... years...?!

16:40.450 --> 16:44.280
Man, 30 years does change things, eh?

16:44.510 --> 16:48.550
Who'd have imagined rare magical 
creatures like these would live here?

16:48.960 --> 16:52.720
Master Allen, could she be a dark elf...?

16:52.720 --> 16:55.530
Indeed, I thought she was peculiar...

16:55.850 --> 16:57.690
Oh, you could recognize that?

16:57.690 --> 17:00.160
As expected of a hell capybara!

17:00.420 --> 17:02.440
What is that exactly?

17:02.440 --> 17:06.030
A rare breed of elf with an elite status.

17:06.290 --> 17:08.070
They're almost mythological.

17:08.070 --> 17:11.160
A dark elf would be able to survive

17:11.420 --> 17:16.050
on the magical power in the air for at least 
100 years without eating or drinking.

17:16.450 --> 17:22.120
<i>Now we have a fenrir, a hell 
capybara, and a dark elf...</i>

17:22.120 --> 17:26.050
<i>I bet no one has ever seen 
three like them together before.</i>

17:26.580 --> 17:33.080
<i>But what would urge a dark elf 
into hiding for 30 years...?</i>

17:33.080 --> 17:36.580
I'm considered missing, aren't I?

17:36.840 --> 17:37.720
<i>Crap.</i>

17:38.140 --> 17:39.570
Yes...?

17:39.570 --> 17:42.590
I see, I get it.

17:43.060 --> 17:46.820
<i>If the previous resident is still here, 
what happens to the ownership rights?</i>

17:48.320 --> 17:51.340
<i>This is going to be a legal nightmare!</i>

17:51.340 --> 17:53.370
<i>But Charlotte is a wanted person,</i>

17:53.370 --> 17:56.460
<i>and there's no better place 
than here for her to hide.</i>

17:56.460 --> 17:58.760
<i>The same goes for Lü and Gosetsu.</i>

17:58.760 --> 18:01.990
<i>I must smooth things out, 
no matter what the cost.</i>

18:03.590 --> 18:06.520
Dorothea, I've got a proposal for you.

18:06.520 --> 18:07.590
What's up?

18:07.860 --> 18:12.970
I'm hesitant to ask, but would you 
consider selling me this mansion?

18:12.970 --> 18:14.620
Hmm...

18:19.570 --> 18:21.490
Sure, why not!

18:22.500 --> 18:28.000
I actually prefer the basement, so 
you're free to use the mansion.

18:28.000 --> 18:29.920
I appreciate it!

18:29.920 --> 18:33.250
Let's discuss the price at a later date...

18:33.250 --> 18:35.750
No, I don't need any money.

18:36.010 --> 18:36.760
Huh?!

18:37.070 --> 18:41.270
Instead, I'd like to 
propose one condition.

18:41.560 --> 18:45.260
I need you to help me get 
out of this predicament!

18:46.810 --> 18:50.270
I'd rather pay you since that's easier...

18:50.930 --> 18:52.020
Um...

18:52.290 --> 18:57.020
She seems to be in trouble, so 
perhaps we can hear her out?

18:58.360 --> 19:00.400
Well, but still...

19:00.400 --> 19:04.280
I-If there's anything I 
can do, I'd like to help!

19:04.610 --> 19:06.750
If Mommy's helping, then I'll help, too!

19:06.750 --> 19:09.040
I shall lend a hand as well.

19:12.770 --> 19:15.190
Okay, fine...

19:15.640 --> 19:17.920
Tell us what you need.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.620
Oh yeah?!

19:19.620 --> 19:20.940
Thanks a bunch!

19:21.520 --> 19:25.650
But this favor is only for Mister 
Allen and Miss Charlotte,

19:25.650 --> 19:28.420
so I only need you two.

19:32.430 --> 19:37.700
So, to help you out of your predicament, 
what do you want us to do?

19:37.700 --> 19:41.710
Before we go into that, 
may I tell you my story?

19:42.700 --> 19:45.510
I used to be an author of multiple genres,

19:45.510 --> 19:49.900
from horror and mystery, 
to social justice and history.

19:50.390 --> 19:52.460
I was popular in the industry,

19:52.460 --> 19:56.720
and I also considered myself to be a genius.

19:57.590 --> 20:01.710
But one day, I tried to write 
a romance novel...

20:02.050 --> 20:05.470
and found myself in a super heavy slump.

20:05.470 --> 20:09.460
The deadline approached, but I 
couldn't produce even one sentence.

20:09.720 --> 20:12.470
Driven into a corner, I...

20:16.980 --> 20:19.550
Don't tell me you've been...

20:19.550 --> 20:24.500
running away from your deadline 
in the basement for 30 years?

20:24.500 --> 20:28.990
Because my editor is extremely scary!

20:29.590 --> 20:31.980
<i>This one is, to put it mildly...</i>

20:31.980 --> 20:33.570
Garbage.

20:33.570 --> 20:34.680
Yup, yup.

20:35.190 --> 20:38.520
I have no obligation to 
help someone like this...

20:38.810 --> 20:43.260
I'm starting to feel I'd rather 
not part with the mansion.

20:43.800 --> 20:46.820
But I can't leave someone in trouble alone.

20:47.240 --> 20:51.150
My 30 year slump will finally be over!

20:53.280 --> 20:56.950
I got goosebumps looking at the two of you!

20:56.950 --> 21:01.270
I'm certain this combination will be a hit!

21:01.270 --> 21:03.790
Is that... so...?

21:05.960 --> 21:12.660
I just want to make the world 
happy with my wonderful writing!

21:12.960 --> 21:15.930
You understand, right, Miss Charlotte?!

21:16.210 --> 21:17.910
Y-Yes...

21:18.130 --> 21:21.410
So? What exactly do you need us to do?

21:22.040 --> 21:23.410
I see...

21:23.750 --> 21:26.570
<i>The couple is a bossy type 
and a delicate, lovely girl.</i>

21:26.570 --> 21:29.190
<i>Love that setting...</i>

21:29.190 --> 21:32.930
<i>My sensor is reacting like crazy!</i>

21:33.430 --> 21:35.740
Are you listening to me?

21:35.740 --> 21:37.430
What are you making us do?

21:39.230 --> 21:41.450
Isn't that obvious?

21:43.060 --> 21:44.960
Come on, you two!

21:44.960 --> 21:49.890
For the sake of the new novel by extraordinary
author, Dorothea Gri'mm Wallenstein,

21:49.890 --> 21:53.340
I will need to you act lovey-dovey 
right here, right now!

21:55.840 --> 21:58.420
What?!

23:30.730 --> 23:32.060
What does "lovey-dovey" mean?

23:32.060 --> 23:34.730
For a man and a woman to flirt with each other.

23:34.730 --> 23:36.580
Next episode, "Naughty Skit."

23:35.220 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.220 --> 23:39.970
<b>Naughty Skit</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:38.210
I'll make them do <i>this</i> and <i>that</i>...

23:38.210 --> 23:39.180
I'll make them do <i>this</i> and <i>that</i>...

23:39.180 --> 23:41.180
Gross.
